        "Simple present — habits and facts: \"She walks to college every day.\" Add -s or -es to the verb with he, she and it.": "المضارع البسيط (simple present) — للعادات والحقائق: \"She walks to college every day.\" أضف -s أو -es إلى الفعل مع he و she و it.",
