        "Prepositions: in, on and at": "حروف الجر (Prepositions): in و on و at",
        "Prepositions show where or when something is. In, on and at are the most common, and the most often mixed up.": "حروف الجر تبيّن أين أو متى يكون الشيء. In و on و at هي الأكثر استعمالًا، وهي أيضًا أكثر ما يخلط الناس بينها.",
        "Time: \"at\" for an exact time (at 7 o'clock, at night); \"on\" for days and dates (on Monday, on 15 August); \"in\" for months, years and parts of the day (in May, in 2025, in the morning).": "الوقت: \"at\" للوقت المحدد بالضبط (at 7 o'clock, at night)؛ و \"on\" للأيام والتواريخ (on Monday, on 15 August)؛ و \"in\" للشهور والسنوات وأجزاء اليوم (in May, in 2025, in the morning).",
        "Place: \"at\" for a point (at the bus stop); \"on\" for a surface (on the table); \"in\" for inside an area (in the room, in Bengaluru).": "المكان: \"at\" لنقطة محددة (at the bus stop)؛ و \"on\" لسطح (on the table)؛ و \"in\" لداخل مكان ما (in the room, in Bengaluru).",
